	(lib_symbols)
	(text "BLOCK: temp_sense\n\nSCOPE\n  Two temperature probe points to 1 degC accuracy (REQ-EL-07): at the load\n  cell, and at the mid-point of the linear encoder measurement rail.\n  ADS1120 external SPI ADC (.ioc net ADS1120_nCS; block diagram\n  \"ADS1120 ADC (temperature measurement)\"). Both probes are labelled\n  RTD / NTC on the block diagram - support both, with IDAC excitation /\n  ratiometric reference, probe connectors and input protection. NOTE: motor FET temperature (MOTOR_FETTEMP PA4) is NOT in\n  this block - it goes to the STM32 internal ADC and belongs to\n  motor_drive (DEC-0011).\n\nINTERFACES - the binding contract between blocks.\nReconciled against docs/FAFF-2-Electronics-Full.svg (block diagram) and\nhardware/cubemx/ARIA_SRB_FAFF_2_POC_CBs_1.ioc (MCU pin-map authority).\nNeed something not listed here? Raise it - do not invent it.\n  IN   analog rail + reference, AGND\n  IN   J-T1 (load cell probe), J-T2 (encoder rail mid-point probe)\n  OUT  ADS1120_nCS PD3 -> mcu\n  IN/OUT CONFIG_SPI (SPI2): SCK PA9, MISO PB14, MOSI PB15 - SHARED BUS\n       shared with nvm_calibration and motor_drive; chip selects are\n       per-peripheral, so bus loading/termination is a joint concern.\n\nSTATUS: stub. No circuitry drawn yet - this sheet is reserved for the\nfollow-up block task that owns this file. Invoke /schematic-style before\nthe first edit, and delete this note once the block is drawn."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
